  "disclaimerDesc": "Before using FlClash (\"the Software\"), please read this statement carefully and make sure you understand it. Tapping \"Agree\" means you have read and understood what follows. If you do not want to continue, tap \"Exit\".",
  "disclaimerSoftwareTitle": "Nature of the software",
  "disclaimerSoftwareContent": "The Software is an open-source network proxy client built on the Clash.Meta (mihomo) core. It only provides local tooling such as configuration management, rule-based routing, and traffic forwarding.",
