  "disclaimerUsageContent": "Any commercial activity anyone carries out with the Software, including paid distribution, bundled sales, or use as part of a commercial service, is unrelated to the Software's developers, who do not endorse, support, or guarantee it.\n\nYou are responsible for complying with the laws where you live, and you bear the consequences of any unlawful use of the Software.",
