  "disclaimerLicenseContent": "The Software is open source under the GPL-3.0 license. Under that license you may run, study, modify, and distribute it; when you distribute the Software or a modified version, you must provide its source code under GPL-3.0 as well and keep the original copyright notices.\n\nThird-party components in the Software, including the Clash.Meta core, follow their own licenses. The original authors are not responsible for any problem arising from versions modified or distributed by others.",
